# Performance

Likely bottlenecks: source fanout, duplicate work, LLM calls, dashboard history
queries, concurrent scans. Measure with documented conditions. No random
micro-optimizations. Prevent N+1 on event and signal pages. List and scan
paths must use explicit page, evidence, source, and concurrency limits.
Record RSS and peak RSS on every benchmark run.
